t":"포트","x":1742,"y":693,"width":65,"height":28},{"text":"80","x":1821,"y":694,"width":32,"height":31}]},{"text":"을 포함하는 TCP SYN 패킷을 수신하지만, 호스트는 포트 80에서 연결을 수락하지","words":[{"text":"을","x":535,"y":748,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"포함하는","x":586,"y":749,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":736,"y":753,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"SYN","x":824,"y":753,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"패킷을","x":918,"y":748,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"수신하지만,","x":1035,"y":748,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"호스트는","x":1233,"y":751,"width":139,"height":35},{"text":"포트","x":1388,"y":753,"width":69,"height":28},{"text":"80에서","x":1475,"y":750,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"연결을","x":1604,"y":750,"width":105,"height":36},{"text":"수락하지","x":1724,"y":749,"width":125,"height":41}]},{"text":"않고 있다고 가정하久H즉, 포트 80에서 웹 서버로 동작하지 않고 있다). 그러면 호스트","words":[{"text":"않고","x":536,"y":808,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"있다고","x":618,"y":809,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"가정하久H즉,","x":731,"y":809,"width":187,"height":39},{"text":"포트","x":933,"y":812,"width":68,"height":28},{"text":"80에서","x":1015,"y":808,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"웹","x":1136,"y":809,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"서버로","x":1183,"y":809,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"동작하지","x":1297,"y":810,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"않고","x":1451,"y":810,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"있다).","x":1536,"y":810,"width":88,"height":38},{"text":"그러면","x":1641,"y":809,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":1760,"y":811,"width":93,"height":33}]},{"text":"는 출발지로 특별한 리셋 세그먼트를 보낼 것이다. 이 TCP 세그먼트는 1로 설정한","words":[{"text":"는","x":533,"y":870,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"출발지로","x":584,"y":869,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"특별한","x":738,"y":869,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"리셋","x":859,"y":869,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":941,"y":869,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"보낼","x":1130,"y":870,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":1218,"y":870,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":1349,"y":870,"w